WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:55.000 --> 00:58.000
"Not Yours"

3
00:58.100 --> 01:00.800
(Episode 5)

4
01:04.920 --> 01:05.879
Who are you looking for?

5
01:05.920 --> 01:07.760
I'm here to see Pao Bei.

6
01:08.159 --> 01:08.959
Pao Bei?

7
01:09.120 --> 01:09.560
Yeah.

8
01:09.920 --> 01:10.920
Alright, just a moment.

9
01:11.879 --> 01:12.879
Okay.

10
01:20.760 --> 01:21.760
Can I park this here?

11
01:22.079 --> 01:23.079
Sure.

12
01:29.359 --> 01:30.359
Excuse me,

13
01:30.519 --> 01:31.640
who are you looking for?

14
01:33.439 --> 01:36.519
Mingkun asked me to drop off some things for Pao Bei.

15
01:37.599 --> 01:38.599
Follow me.

16
01:39.640 --> 01:40.719
Oh, okay.

17
01:49.439 --> 01:50.439
Let go of me!

18
01:56.640 --> 01:57.680
What's your deal?

19
02:01.439 --> 02:02.159
Fine, if you want to play,

20
02:02.160 --> 02:03.439
can't you be a little gentler?

21
02:22.319 --> 02:23.319
Scared now?

22
02:24.240 --> 02:25.256
Still dare to mess with me?

23
02:25.280 --> 02:26.599
I'm not scared of you.

24
02:26.680 --> 02:28.000
Not one bit.

25
02:32.680 --> 02:33.400
Call me Daddy.

26
02:33.560 --> 02:34.960
Call me Daddy and I'll forgive you.

27
02:43.960 --> 02:45.120
What's so funny?

28
02:47.759 --> 02:50.360
I'm laughing at how childish you are.

29
02:51.919 --> 02:53.120
What did you say?

30
02:55.360 --> 02:58.400
Only little kids care about making people call them Daddy.

31
03:09.080 --> 03:10.080
Keep going.

32
03:10.159 --> 03:11.199
Why'd you stop?

33
03:11.840 --> 03:13.000
Is that all you've got?

34
04:19.240 --> 04:20.240
Have a seat for a moment.

35
04:20.279 --> 04:21.999
Mr. Mingkun will be right with you.

36
04:22.000 --> 04:23.000
Oh, thanks.

37
04:23.240 --> 04:24.240
Okay to step on this?

38
04:24.879 --> 04:25.879
Yes, go ahead.

39
04:26.199 --> 04:27.199
Okay.

40
04:37.920 --> 04:38.600
Is this all of it?

41
04:38.600 --> 04:39.600
Ah, yeah.

42
04:39.839 --> 04:41.160
That's everything Pao Bei has.

43
04:41.639 --> 04:42.758
Thanks for coming all this way.

44
04:42.759 --> 04:43.759
Please, have a seat.

45
04:44.279 --> 04:46.040
Peter, get Mr. A Pong a glass of water.

46
04:53.639 --> 04:54.639
Pao Bei?

47
04:55.160 --> 04:56.160
Pao Bei!

48
04:56.639 --> 04:57.319
Pao Bei!

49
04:57.480 --> 04:58.480
Wake up!

50
04:58.720 --> 04:59.720
Pao Bei!

51
05:03.800 --> 05:06.680
Mingkun!

52
05:09.399 --> 05:10.719
Excuse me for a moment.

53
05:10.720 --> 05:11.720
I'll be right back.

54
05:11.920 --> 05:12.920
Sure.

55
05:12.959 --> 05:13.959
Go ahead.

56
05:21.279 --> 05:22.279
Mingkun!

57
05:22.319 --> 05:23.319
Mingkun!

58
05:23.959 --> 05:25.959
Wake up!

59
05:36.959 --> 05:38.199
You freaking tricked me!

60
06:14.160 --> 06:15.240
Get back here!

61
06:15.519 --> 06:16.560
Help!

62
06:17.079 --> 06:17.920
Somebody help!

63
06:17.920 --> 06:18.839
Help me!

64
06:18.840 --> 06:20.000
That's Pao Bei's voice!

65
06:22.000 --> 06:23.239
Did you guys hear that?

66
06:23.240 --> 06:24.079
Help!

67
06:24.080 --> 06:25.960
It's none of your business. Back to your posts.

68
06:27.279 --> 06:28.279
Get over here!

69
06:30.319 --> 06:31.360
Mingkun, save me!

70
06:32.079 --> 06:33.079
He's trying to kill me!

71
06:34.720 --> 06:35.720
Who's trying to kill you?

72
06:35.759 --> 06:37.039
A Pong? What are you doing here?

73
06:37.439 --> 06:38.439
Young Master!

74
06:38.519 --> 06:39.639
I knew it was you again!

75
06:40.000 --> 06:40.759
Today—.

76
06:40.800 --> 06:42.320
Today, I'm gonna do the world a favor!

77
06:42.920 --> 06:43.319
Young Master!

78
06:43.319 --> 06:44.319
A Pong, calm down!

79
06:44.439 --> 06:45.680
We were just messing around!

80
06:46.120 --> 06:47.240
Let go!

81
06:49.879 --> 06:51.198
He wasn't trying to kill me.

82
06:51.199 --> 06:52.160
Seriously, believe me!

83
06:52.160 --> 06:53.160
Swear to it, then!

84
06:53.759 --> 06:54.759
I swear to God!

85
06:55.199 --> 06:56.519
If I'm lying,

86
06:56.759 --> 06:58.039
may the heavens punish me

87
06:58.040 --> 06:59.040
by making me marry him!

88
06:59.079 --> 07:00.079
Happy now?

89
07:05.639 --> 07:06.919
You're coming with me right now.

90
07:07.759 --> 07:08.759
Young Master!

91
07:10.800 --> 07:11.800
Young Master!

92
07:15.480 --> 07:16.160
Stop fighting!

93
07:16.360 --> 07:16.959
Stop it!

94
07:17.279 --> 07:18.319
Everybody, stop right now!

95
07:53.160 --> 07:54.160
Pao Bei?

96
07:54.639 --> 07:55.480
What happened to you?

97
07:55.481 --> 07:56.519
Why are you soaking wet?

98
07:56.759 --> 07:58.639
Go change your clothes before you catch a cold.

99
07:58.920 --> 07:59.920
I'm fine.

100
08:00.680 --> 08:01.696
Just did some chores earlier.

101
08:01.720 --> 08:02.720
Oh.

102
08:06.759 --> 08:07.879
What's going on?

103
08:08.160 --> 08:09.240
Why is he here too?

104
08:09.439 --> 08:10.920
And dressed like that?

105
08:11.959 --> 08:12.959
A Pong?

106
08:13.000 --> 08:14.000
What brings you here?

107
08:15.040 --> 08:16.040
Oh.

108
08:18.920 --> 08:19.920
Let's go.

109
08:20.560 --> 08:21.920
What a wasted trip.

110
08:22.040 --> 08:23.520
Ended up in a total mess for nothing.

111
08:23.959 --> 08:24.680
What do you mean?

112
08:24.680 --> 08:25.680
Where are we going?

113
08:25.879 --> 08:27.119
Your boss said

114
08:27.120 --> 08:28.120
you're free to go.

115
08:28.519 --> 08:30.359
Guess that fight wasn't for nothing after all.

116
08:31.920 --> 08:33.079
Did he really say I could leave?

117
08:33.080 --> 08:33.519
Mingkun?

118
08:34.080 --> 08:35.080
Yes.

119
09:25.120 --> 09:26.000
Fine, if you want to play,

120
09:26.001 --> 09:27.201
can't you be a little gentler?

121
09:29.600 --> 09:30.600
Scared now?

122
09:31.519 --> 09:32.599
Still dare to mess with me?

123
09:32.799 --> 09:33.960
I'm not scared of you.

124
09:34.120 --> 09:35.360
Not one bit.

125
09:35.679 --> 09:36.480
Call me Daddy.

126
09:36.481 --> 09:37.881
Call me Daddy and I'll forgive you.

127
09:49.720 --> 09:51.080
Is he really not afraid?

128
09:51.519 --> 09:53.599
It's the first time I've seen that look in his eyes.

129
09:53.720 --> 09:54.720
And as for me,

130
09:54.960 --> 09:57.399
why did it suddenly remind me of myself as a kid?

131
10:11.840 --> 10:12.840
Young Master.

132
10:13.480 --> 10:14.480
What is it?

133
10:14.639 --> 10:16.639
Should I send Mr. Milan to your room?

134
10:24.399 --> 10:25.399
What do you mean?

135
10:25.840 --> 10:26.559
Why would you call him here?

136
10:26.560 --> 10:27.760
Isn't this your usual routine?

137
10:30.759 --> 10:32.558
He's currently terminating his contract with his old agency.

138
10:32.559 --> 10:33.879
He's an artist I'm about to sign.

139
10:34.639 --> 10:36.399
I don't sleep with my own staff.

140
10:37.279 --> 10:38.480
Right, understood.

141
10:39.240 --> 10:40.240
Didn't he say anything?

142
10:40.720 --> 10:42.480
By "he," you mean...

143
10:44.600 --> 10:46.039
Do I need to book you a brain scan?

144
10:47.159 --> 10:48.759
If you mean the "he" I'm thinking of,

145
10:49.240 --> 10:50.240
he didn't say a word.

146
10:50.440 --> 10:51.640
Didn't beg me to stay, either.

147
10:51.919 --> 10:54.080
In fact, he looked pretty happy about it.

148
10:54.159 --> 10:55.839
You've been talking a bit too much lately.

149
10:56.679 --> 10:58.240
I wasn't finished yet, Young Master.

150
10:58.559 --> 10:59.559
Spill it.

151
10:59.600 --> 11:02.518
Well, Mr. Milan just asked

152
11:02.519 --> 11:03.678
about the personal assistant he needs.

153
11:03.679 --> 11:05.559
Will we provide one, or should he hire his own?

154
11:06.960 --> 11:08.240
You decide.

155
11:08.720 --> 11:10.360
Shall I get you some painkillers?

156
11:11.360 --> 11:12.360
No need.

157
12:00.159 --> 12:02.279
Trying to get rid of me so I don't ruin your fun?

158
12:02.879 --> 12:04.519
Expecting me to just walk away like this?

159
12:05.639 --> 12:06.720
No way in hell.

160
12:07.679 --> 12:08.960
Even if I leave,

161
12:09.720 --> 12:12.080
I'm getting some dirt on you first.

162
12:36.759 --> 12:38.879
Wait, did he go to Milan's room to...

163
12:46.639 --> 12:47.639
No, forget it.

164
12:48.279 --> 12:49.919
He's always been that kind of guy anyway.

165
12:50.039 --> 12:51.359
Never sincere with anyone.

166
12:51.360 --> 12:52.759
Just a rich playboy.

167
12:54.960 --> 12:56.360
My top priority right now

168
12:56.840 --> 12:58.360
is to get dirt on him

169
12:58.960 --> 13:00.039
and gather evidence.

170
13:07.159 --> 13:08.799
Why are the key and the doll both gone?

171
13:12.519 --> 13:13.840
Don't tell me he found out.

172
13:15.639 --> 13:16.919
Or maybe...

173
13:18.440 --> 13:20.559
he hated the new clothes I made and threw it away?

174
13:21.480 --> 13:22.480
What the heck?

175
13:22.679 --> 13:23.879
What kind of person does that?

176
13:31.840 --> 13:32.840
Listen carefully.

177
13:33.240 --> 13:35.159
Only the Young Master is allowed in this room.

178
13:35.600 --> 13:37.879
Anyone else who enters without permission

179
13:38.240 --> 13:39.840
will face severe punishment.

180
14:16.759 --> 14:17.759
Didn't you leave?

181
14:20.120 --> 14:21.440
Who said I left?

182
14:22.200 --> 14:23.200
I said I'd wait—

183
14:24.360 --> 14:25.576
wait for the rain to stop before leaving.

184
14:25.600 --> 14:26.799
Then what about your friend?

185
14:27.360 --> 14:28.360
He didn't leave.

186
14:28.440 --> 14:29.959
Probably fell asleep in my room.

187
14:29.960 --> 14:31.960
Then why did you show up at the door of that room?

188
14:33.919 --> 14:34.679
I...

189
14:34.680 --> 14:37.278
I was just looking around to see

190
14:37.279 --> 14:38.559
if there was an empty room.

191
14:38.759 --> 14:40.319
Couldn't you just ask Mingkun for that?

192
14:41.000 --> 14:42.320
You think I'm like you,

193
14:42.559 --> 14:44.079
bossing Mingkun around for everything?

194
14:52.159 --> 14:53.159
Come here.

195
14:55.159 --> 14:56.120
What now?

196
14:56.121 --> 14:57.281
Aren't you tired of standing?

197
15:09.240 --> 15:10.480
I'm fine sitting right here.

198
15:36.919 --> 15:38.039
What are you doing now?

199
15:56.799 --> 15:57.799
Did you...

200
15:58.279 --> 15:59.279
make this?

201
16:00.279 --> 16:01.600
So you didn't throw it away.

202
16:02.360 --> 16:03.360
Throw it away?

203
16:03.960 --> 16:05.039
Are you crazy?

204
16:06.120 --> 16:07.879
This thing means the world to me.

205
16:08.360 --> 16:09.560
Why would I ever throw it out?

206
16:10.120 --> 16:11.559
Who's talking about your doll?

207
16:12.039 --> 16:13.039
I thought...

208
16:14.679 --> 16:15.679
You thought what?

209
16:18.840 --> 16:19.919
Nothing.

210
16:22.919 --> 16:23.919
Spit it out.

211
16:24.159 --> 16:25.159
Don't make me force you.

212
16:30.840 --> 16:31.919
I just thought...

213
16:33.799 --> 16:35.279
I thought you didn't like the outfit.

214
16:43.320 --> 16:44.520
It's not that I don't like it.

215
16:45.440 --> 16:46.440
It's just...

216
16:47.240 --> 16:48.960
this is its first time wearing new clothes.

217
16:49.559 --> 16:50.879
It doesn't matter if I like it.

218
16:52.000 --> 16:54.279
What matters is that it likes it.

219
16:59.840 --> 17:00.919
Does it like it, then?

220
17:03.279 --> 17:04.400
Are you out of your mind?

221
17:04.839 --> 17:06.519
Making me ask a doll that can't even talk?

222
17:07.519 --> 17:09.240
A doll having its own preferences?

223
17:10.720 --> 17:12.119
Doesn't that sound even crazier?

224
17:16.319 --> 17:17.400
Yeah.

225
17:17.559 --> 17:18.559
You're right.

226
17:19.519 --> 17:20.640
I am crazy.

227
17:22.119 --> 17:23.240
But...

228
17:24.559 --> 17:26.039
you're pretty messed up yourself.

229
18:13.480 --> 18:14.559
Are you going to sleep?

230
18:15.039 --> 18:16.039
Yeah.

231
18:16.279 --> 18:17.279
I'm sleepy.

232
19:23.839 --> 19:24.839
What's wrong?

233
19:25.119 --> 19:26.960
Weren't you trying to strangle me earlier?

234
19:27.680 --> 19:28.896
What kind of game are you playing now?

235
19:28.920 --> 19:30.280
Didn't you say you weren't scared?

236
19:30.359 --> 19:31.720
I'm not scared.

237
19:32.079 --> 19:33.679
But for the sake of my brother and sister,

238
19:33.680 --> 19:34.798
I'd like to live a few more years.

239
19:34.799 --> 19:35.720
Unlike you.

240
19:35.721 --> 19:37.240
You only have a brother and sister.

241
19:38.200 --> 19:40.280
I'm responsible for an entire corporation of people.

242
19:40.519 --> 19:42.519
I don't like people with a bad temper.

243
19:43.680 --> 19:45.758
Have you ever stopped to think why I got mad?

244
19:45.759 --> 19:46.759
I...

245
19:47.920 --> 19:49.758
It's not like I lied to you on purpose.

246
19:49.759 --> 19:51.400
I thought I could fix it.

247
19:51.440 --> 19:52.880
It was already broken to begin with.

248
19:55.000 --> 19:55.960
Already broken?

249
19:55.961 --> 19:57.361
Then why did you blow up like that?

250
20:01.960 --> 20:04.278
The problem is you glued it so tightly

251
20:04.279 --> 20:05.719
it took me forever to get it apart,

252
20:05.720 --> 20:06.720
you know that?

253
20:16.000 --> 20:17.680
You're lucky I didn't make you pay for it,

254
20:17.799 --> 20:19.439
and you're the one giving me an attitude?

255
20:21.519 --> 20:22.519
Turn around.

256
20:27.680 --> 20:29.200
Turn around!

257
20:31.559 --> 20:33.000
Gonna use force again, huh?

258
20:38.559 --> 20:40.079
Are you going to admit you were wrong?

259
20:42.839 --> 20:43.880
Fine, I was wrong.

260
20:44.599 --> 20:46.440
I never should've messed with you that day.

261
20:46.720 --> 20:48.039
Since you already did,

262
20:48.680 --> 20:50.160
just accept your fate.

263
20:56.359 --> 20:57.440
Ow!

264
21:03.519 --> 21:04.839
That really hurts!

265
21:05.920 --> 21:07.038
Let go!

266
21:07.039 --> 21:08.039
It hurts!

267
21:08.680 --> 21:10.335
If you can't even handle this little bit of pain,

268
21:10.359 --> 21:11.919
what are you going to do in the future?

269
21:13.759 --> 21:14.880
What do you mean?

270
21:15.039 --> 21:16.399
What do you mean, "in the future"?

271
21:19.079 --> 21:20.079
Hey!

272
21:20.559 --> 21:21.279
I'm asking you a question!

273
21:21.279 --> 21:22.279
What do you mean by that?

274
21:22.680 --> 21:24.200
You'll find out eventually.

275
21:25.160 --> 21:26.160
Go to sleep.

276
22:16.119 --> 22:17.559
Putting it out with that much left?

277
22:20.640 --> 22:21.799
Didn't someone say

278
22:22.000 --> 22:23.319
smoking is bad for my throat?

279
22:25.799 --> 22:27.960
Since when do you care about your throat?

280
22:33.079 --> 22:35.960
Actually, I've always wanted to know

281
22:36.880 --> 22:39.880
why you came to Tailan without saying a word back then,

282
22:40.440 --> 22:42.240
and deliberately cut off all contact with me—

283
22:43.920 --> 22:45.160
with us.

284
22:48.400 --> 22:50.279
Everyone has their own path to walk.

285
22:51.039 --> 22:52.079
Meeting,

286
22:52.599 --> 22:53.599
parting,

287
22:53.839 --> 22:54.920
reuniting—

288
22:56.039 --> 22:57.519
it's all just a normal part of life.

289
22:58.240 --> 23:00.680
The most important thing is to live in the present.

290
23:09.880 --> 23:10.920
Then do you know

291
23:12.079 --> 23:14.160
why I insisted on coming to Tailan to work?

292
23:16.200 --> 23:17.599
To make money, obviously.

293
23:17.799 --> 23:18.799
What else could it be?

294
23:35.720 --> 23:38.118
I didn't expect you to accept the offer

295
23:38.119 --> 23:40.038
from Yingyu Group so readily, Mr. Milan.

296
23:40.039 --> 23:42.559
Coming to work in Tailan is something I've been fixated on.

297
23:44.079 --> 23:45.079
Oh?

298
23:45.119 --> 23:46.119
Why is that?

299
23:47.160 --> 23:48.400
I'm looking for someone.

300
23:49.359 --> 23:50.959
Someone I've known for a very long time.

301
23:52.000 --> 23:54.079
All I know is that he came to Tailan to work,

302
23:55.519 --> 23:56.519
so I want to find him.

303
24:04.880 --> 24:05.920
Why aren't you asleep yet?

304
24:06.440 --> 24:07.440
What about you?

305
24:09.359 --> 24:10.480
I'm waiting for Pao Bei.

306
24:12.559 --> 24:13.879
I doubt he's coming back tonight.

307
24:16.400 --> 24:17.400
Did he tell you that?

308
24:21.160 --> 24:23.240
How about we make a bet?

309
24:24.759 --> 24:25.759
Bet on what?

310
24:27.240 --> 24:29.000
Let me think.

311
24:31.079 --> 24:32.319
If I win,

312
24:32.599 --> 24:33.959
how about you become my assistant?

313
24:34.640 --> 24:35.640
No way.

314
24:36.119 --> 24:38.199
Are you scared to bet, or scared to be my assistant?

315
24:39.119 --> 24:39.720
Hey,

316
24:40.079 --> 24:41.798
I have a perfectly good job at the restaurant.

317
24:41.799 --> 24:42.999
Why would I be your assistant?

318
24:43.240 --> 24:45.599
Besides, aren't you signing with that jerk?

319
24:45.880 --> 24:47.360
There's no way I'm working under him.

320
24:47.640 --> 24:49.200
He won't be the one bossing you around.

321
24:49.839 --> 24:51.319
You just need to help me out.

322
24:51.680 --> 24:53.240
He'd still be my boss on paper.

323
24:57.559 --> 24:59.200
So are you taking the bet or not?

324
25:00.000 --> 25:01.000
Well...

325
25:04.480 --> 25:05.720
Forget it, coward.

326
25:06.240 --> 25:07.519
I knew you wouldn't dare.

327
25:19.720 --> 25:21.239
These are the leftover lottery tickets I couldn't sell earlier.

328
25:21.240 --> 25:22.680
If there's a winning ticket in here,

329
25:23.039 --> 25:24.039
I'll be your assistant.

330
25:24.559 --> 25:25.559
How about that?

331
25:25.640 --> 25:26.680
Do you dare take that bet?

332
25:28.920 --> 25:30.920
The odds of winning are way too low!

333
25:31.880 --> 25:34.440
So, do you dare or not?

334
25:37.920 --> 25:38.920
Deal.

335
25:40.119 --> 25:41.599
And if none of them win,

336
25:41.799 --> 25:43.400
I'll buy out all your tickets tomorrow.

337
25:45.480 --> 25:47.216
You really have no head for business, do you?

338
25:47.240 --> 25:48.240
I was just kidding.

339
25:49.000 --> 25:50.000
I'm not kidding.

340
25:51.359 --> 25:52.359
I'll take the bet.

341
25:57.319 --> 25:58.799
I believe in miracles.

342
26:02.240 --> 26:03.000
Fine.

343
26:03.160 --> 26:04.160
As long as you're in.

344
26:04.599 --> 26:05.759
Just don't cry when you lose.

345
26:26.880 --> 26:27.839
Boss!

346
26:27.839 --> 26:28.839
We're back!

347
26:29.640 --> 26:31.559
Boss, we're back!

348
26:32.880 --> 26:34.080
Pace yourself with the drinks!

349
26:37.839 --> 26:38.839
Boss!

350
26:41.359 --> 26:42.359
Boss, we're heading out.

351
26:42.360 --> 26:43.400
Hope you enjoyed the food!

352
26:44.039 --> 26:44.680
Take care!

353
26:44.681 --> 26:45.798
Come again next time!

354
26:45.799 --> 26:46.799
Sure!

355
26:47.240 --> 26:48.240
Get home safe!

356
26:48.680 --> 26:51.400
Boss, why aren't you welcoming the two of us back?

357
26:52.240 --> 26:53.880
If you're here as customers,

358
26:54.000 --> 26:55.079
of course you're welcome.

359
26:56.039 --> 26:56.759
Wait,

360
26:56.760 --> 26:58.640
Boss, we've only been gone a few days.

361
26:58.799 --> 27:00.439
How can you act like you don't know us?

362
27:00.440 --> 27:01.798
How could I forget?

363
27:01.799 --> 27:03.735
A Pong and Pao Bei, the guys who started a brawl in my restaurant

364
27:03.759 --> 27:07.200
and smashed up the place.

365
27:08.400 --> 27:11.000
Boss, what happened last time was definitely my fault.

366
27:11.720 --> 27:13.480
I promise you it'll never happen again.

367
27:13.759 --> 27:14.799
I'm really sorry about it.

368
27:14.880 --> 27:15.720
Please forgive me.

369
27:15.721 --> 27:16.960
Save your apologies.

370
27:17.359 --> 27:20.119
Boss P'Eng already paid for all the damages.

371
27:21.119 --> 27:22.839
Please let bygones be bygones.

372
27:23.400 --> 27:25.720
The two of us will definitely work even harder from now on

373
27:25.799 --> 27:26.999
and cook even better dishes for the customers.

374
27:27.000 --> 27:28.000
Boss, more beer!

375
27:28.240 --> 27:29.240
Coming right up!

376
27:31.960 --> 27:32.960
What do we do?

377
27:36.079 --> 27:37.079
Enjoy!

378
27:38.200 --> 27:39.000
Let's just go get changed first.

379
27:39.000 --> 27:39.640
Come on.

380
27:39.799 --> 27:41.319
Hey, where do you think you're going?

381
27:43.720 --> 27:44.839
To serve the customers!

382
27:45.920 --> 27:47.558
I already told you, don't bother.

383
27:47.559 --> 27:49.078
I can't afford to keep you two on anymore.

384
27:49.079 --> 27:50.239
If you're not here to eat,

385
27:50.240 --> 27:51.240
please leave.

386
27:51.799 --> 27:52.319
Wait,

387
27:52.480 --> 27:53.039
Boss!

388
27:53.040 --> 27:54.879
Didn't we just promise there wouldn't be a next time?

389
27:54.880 --> 27:56.319
Even so, I can't hire you back.

390
27:56.480 --> 27:59.078
I can't afford to offend a massive corporation again.

391
27:59.079 --> 28:00.439
I'm just running a small business here.

392
28:00.440 --> 28:01.799
I don't have the guts for that.

393
28:02.640 --> 28:03.640
Boss,

394
28:03.799 --> 28:04.879
I'm begging you.

395
28:04.880 --> 28:06.479
Just give us one more chance.

396
28:06.480 --> 28:08.159
I guarantee those guys will never come back here again.

397
28:08.160 --> 28:09.240
Please, Boss.

398
28:09.720 --> 28:10.480
Boss, seriously.

399
28:10.480 --> 28:11.279
Boss,

400
28:11.280 --> 28:12.518
just give us one more shot.

401
28:12.519 --> 28:14.295
Their people already made it very clear to me.

402
28:14.319 --> 28:17.199
They offered free promotion and a partnership for my restaurant,

403
28:17.200 --> 28:18.519
on one condition—

404
28:18.759 --> 28:20.400
I can't employ the two of you anymore.

405
28:20.640 --> 28:21.920
I'm a businessman, after all.

406
28:22.240 --> 28:23.759
A deal is a deal.

407
28:24.759 --> 28:25.839
Just go home.

408
28:28.279 --> 28:29.480
That damned devil!

409
28:29.799 --> 28:31.440
How dare he mess with our livelihood!

410
28:34.000 --> 28:34.519
Shake it off.

411
28:34.839 --> 28:35.960
We're good cooks.

412
28:36.279 --> 28:37.720
We'll definitely find another job.

413
28:42.920 --> 28:44.039
The harder life gets,

414
28:44.400 --> 28:45.400
the harder I'll fight!

415
28:45.880 --> 28:46.880
Hang in there, Pao Bei!

416
28:47.240 --> 28:48.839
I can't let him look down on me!

417
29:26.160 --> 29:27.160
What's wrong?

418
29:31.359 --> 29:32.719
Should I call him over?

419
29:32.720 --> 29:33.720
Why would I call him?

420
29:34.119 --> 29:35.639
Wasn't he the one who wanted to leave?

421
29:36.079 --> 29:36.839
If he wants to go, let him go!

422
29:36.840 --> 29:37.920
Nobody asked him to stay!

423
29:38.039 --> 29:39.679
Besides, he owes me money in the first place!

424
29:39.680 --> 29:40.758
Doesn't he have to pay off his debt?

425
29:40.759 --> 29:41.798
What the hell is his problem?

426
29:41.799 --> 29:43.880
And what do you mean by asking to call him over?

427
29:45.039 --> 29:46.199
What I meant was,

428
29:46.200 --> 29:48.320
should I call Master Chen over to give you a massage?

429
29:48.359 --> 29:50.680
Your shoulders look a little stiff.

430
29:54.400 --> 29:56.279
Why are you meddling so much?

431
29:56.960 --> 29:58.160
Do I look that fragile to you?

432
29:58.559 --> 29:59.880
Right, my mistake.

433
30:00.079 --> 30:01.160
Please get some rest.

434
30:02.119 --> 30:03.119
Oh, by the way,

435
30:03.160 --> 30:04.758
tomorrow I'm accompanying Mr. Milan

436
30:04.759 --> 30:06.440
to that event at the amusement park.

437
30:06.880 --> 30:09.240
Also, we need to find him an assistant as soon as possible.

438
30:09.319 --> 30:10.319
Got it.

439
30:18.680 --> 30:20.255
Are you sure you don't want me to call him over?

440
30:20.279 --> 30:21.679
I already told you not to call him!

441
30:22.119 --> 30:23.119
Stop nagging!

442
30:25.839 --> 30:27.880
This time, I actually meant "him."

443
30:30.640 --> 30:31.640
Why would I look for him?

444
30:31.920 --> 30:33.400
I don't care if he comes back or not!

445
30:33.640 --> 30:34.760
Whoever goes looking for him

446
30:35.319 --> 30:36.319
is a dog!

447
30:47.319 --> 30:49.359
Do you know what time it is? Why isn't he home yet?

448
30:51.079 --> 30:52.079
Now that he's free,

449
30:52.119 --> 30:53.639
he's probably out partying like crazy.

450
31:10.599 --> 31:11.599
Hello?

451
31:11.839 --> 31:13.959
Yes, I'm the one who came in for the interview today.

452
31:15.599 --> 31:16.640
Okay, I understand.

453
31:16.920 --> 31:18.720
If you ever need a chef in the future,

454
31:18.799 --> 31:20.359
please feel free to contact me anytime.

455
31:34.680 --> 31:35.759
What are you doing here?

456
31:37.279 --> 31:38.279
I...

457
31:39.400 --> 31:41.599
I came to see if you ran away like your mom did.

458
31:42.559 --> 31:43.959
I'm not going to run away.

459
31:43.960 --> 31:44.720
Don't worry.

460
31:44.721 --> 31:46.681
I'll still go work at the nursery during the day.

461
31:47.160 --> 31:48.680
I'll do everything I'm supposed to do.

462
31:48.759 --> 31:50.495
Not like I have a choice, since you cut off all my other options.

463
31:50.519 --> 31:51.559
Cut off your options?

464
31:52.279 --> 31:53.359
What are you talking about?

465
31:53.519 --> 31:55.119
Drop the act, Boss P'Eng.

466
31:55.559 --> 31:56.919
Weren't you the one who told my boss

467
31:56.920 --> 31:58.640
to fire A Pong and me?

468
31:58.680 --> 31:59.758
Thanks to you,

469
31:59.759 --> 32:01.480
we're both unemployed now. Happy?

470
32:01.720 --> 32:03.696
When did I ever give your boss an order like that?

471
32:03.720 --> 32:04.759
You're the boss!

472
32:05.119 --> 32:06.976
He specifically said it was someone from Yingyu Group.

473
32:07.000 --> 32:08.000
If you didn't give the order,

474
32:08.001 --> 32:09.200
who else would dare do that?

475
32:10.039 --> 32:11.456
Don't accuse me of things I didn't do!

476
32:11.480 --> 32:12.839
I never gave any order like that.

477
32:13.000 --> 32:14.039
If you don't believe me,

478
32:14.759 --> 32:15.799
go ask Mingkun.

479
32:16.319 --> 32:17.319
Mingkun?

480
32:17.519 --> 32:18.919
Doesn't Mingkun work for you anyway?

481
32:18.920 --> 32:20.480
What's the point of asking him?

482
32:20.920 --> 32:21.920
Forget it.

483
32:22.279 --> 32:24.359
I refuse to believe I can't find a single restaurant

484
32:24.400 --> 32:25.799
that needs a great chef like me.

485
32:31.640 --> 32:33.240
Is there anything else, Boss P'Eng?

486
32:33.759 --> 32:35.319
You didn't bring your goons this time,

487
32:35.680 --> 32:37.560
so I assume you're not here to kidnap me again.

488
32:37.799 --> 32:39.079
If that's all, I'm going inside.

489
32:40.759 --> 32:42.729
I already told you I didn't do it! Why won't you believe me?

490
32:45.680 --> 32:46.720
Whether it was you or not,

491
32:46.960 --> 32:48.120
what difference does it make?

492
32:48.880 --> 32:50.278
I'm already fired anyway.

493
32:50.279 --> 32:51.200
Just drop it.

494
32:51.201 --> 32:52.521
What do you mean, "just drop it"?

495
32:53.440 --> 32:54.679
We're clearing this up right now.

496
32:54.680 --> 32:55.680
Don't you walk away!

497
32:56.880 --> 32:57.919
Give me your boss's number.

498
32:57.920 --> 32:58.759
I'll call him myself.

499
32:58.880 --> 33:00.559
Man, have you looked at the time?

500
33:01.519 --> 33:03.118
Just because you don't sleep doesn't mean nobody else does!

501
33:03.119 --> 33:04.279
I don't care what time it is!

502
33:04.359 --> 33:06.359
Nobody gets to frame me for something I didn't do!

503
33:07.200 --> 33:08.358
Won't give it to me, huh?

504
33:08.359 --> 33:08.920
Fine.

505
33:09.079 --> 33:10.079
I'll ask Mingkun.

506
33:11.319 --> 33:12.839
How can you be so selfish?

507
33:13.319 --> 33:15.239
Does the whole world have to revolve around you?

508
33:15.400 --> 33:16.575
Just because you have some stinking money,

509
33:16.599 --> 33:18.295
you think you can disrupt everyone else's lives?

510
33:18.319 --> 33:19.960
Yeah, that's right! I am selfish, so what?

511
33:20.720 --> 33:21.640
Give me my phone!

512
33:21.640 --> 33:22.640
No!

513
33:22.839 --> 33:23.519
Give it back!

514
33:23.519 --> 33:24.519
No!

515
33:24.720 --> 33:26.616
Promise me you won't bother anyone at this hour,

516
33:26.640 --> 33:27.959
and I'll believe you didn't do it.

517
33:27.960 --> 33:29.160
It had nothing to do with you.

518
33:29.759 --> 33:31.400
It's just my own bad luck, okay?

519
33:31.599 --> 33:32.599
I'll just suck it up.

520
33:32.720 --> 33:33.720
Are you satisfied now?

521
33:40.759 --> 33:42.160
What the hell are you doing?

522
33:43.480 --> 33:44.680
Who told you to grab my phone?

523
33:45.440 --> 33:46.440
Fine!

524
33:46.640 --> 33:47.400
Walk away, then!

525
33:47.401 --> 33:49.239
Let's see which costs more—your phone

526
33:49.240 --> 33:50.359
or my beat-up bike!

527
33:51.039 --> 33:52.039
Bye!

528
34:35.085 --> 34:36.165
Could you please—

529
34:36.760 --> 34:37.920
Keep your voice down!

530
34:38.400 --> 34:39.639
This isn't your giant mansion.

531
34:39.960 --> 34:41.159
Stop waking up the neighbors.

532
34:54.960 --> 34:56.159
Did you do that on purpose?

533
34:56.639 --> 34:57.639
Ow, that hurts!

534
34:59.719 --> 35:01.879
Being this sensitive to pain is going to be a problem.

535
35:02.880 --> 35:03.880
A problem how?

536
35:08.639 --> 35:10.479
I'm saying, if you can't handle a little pain,

537
35:10.800 --> 35:12.360
what are you going to do in the future?

538
35:14.280 --> 35:15.936
If you can't even handle this little bit of pain,

539
35:15.960 --> 35:17.520
what are you going to do in the future?

540
35:20.519 --> 35:21.736
I'm allowed to be sensitive to pain,

541
35:21.760 --> 35:22.760
but you're not.

542
35:25.320 --> 35:26.320
Why am I not allowed?

543
35:27.360 --> 35:28.400
Are you crazy?

544
35:29.840 --> 35:31.559
Not nearly as crazy as you.

545
35:35.920 --> 35:36.920
Your...

546
35:38.280 --> 35:39.280
That bike of yours,

547
35:39.320 --> 35:40.840
the brakes are really busted?

548
35:41.320 --> 35:42.320
Mmm.

549
35:42.559 --> 35:43.000
Yeah,

550
35:43.000 --> 35:43.480
they're broken.

551
35:43.481 --> 35:45.095
If they're broken, why haven't you fixed them?

552
35:45.119 --> 35:46.799
Aren't you afraid of running someone over?

553
35:47.320 --> 35:49.679
You wouldn't understand, but for a poor guy like me,

554
35:49.760 --> 35:51.639
fixing this bike costs a fortune.

555
35:51.800 --> 35:53.280
Plus, I'm pretty broke lately.

556
35:56.639 --> 35:57.920
Are you trying to guilt-trip me?

557
35:59.119 --> 36:00.639
Good thing I'm blessed with good luck,

558
36:01.079 --> 36:02.839
otherwise you would've run me over ages ago.

559
36:03.000 --> 36:04.599
Didn't I tell you a long time ago

560
36:04.719 --> 36:06.159
to stop riding that thing?

561
36:06.480 --> 36:08.000
Don't accuse me of things I didn't do!

562
36:08.039 --> 36:09.479
Oh, so you know how it feels to be falsely accused?

563
36:09.480 --> 36:10.760
Yet you still blamed me earlier!

564
36:17.039 --> 36:18.559
Did you really not set that up?

565
36:19.320 --> 36:19.880
I swear I'm gonna—.

566
36:19.880 --> 36:20.880
Okay!

567
36:21.719 --> 36:23.000
Fine, I blamed you unfairly.

568
36:29.519 --> 36:31.718
Then why would my boss say that?

569
36:31.719 --> 36:34.400
That buddy of yours has a fuse shorter than a stick of dynamite.

570
36:34.960 --> 36:37.040
How many times has he thrown a punch at me on sight?

571
36:37.079 --> 36:38.079
If I were the boss,

572
36:38.119 --> 36:39.199
I wouldn't hire him either.

573
36:39.960 --> 36:41.239
The guy's a walking time bomb.

574
36:43.400 --> 36:44.558
Since you put it that way,

575
36:44.559 --> 36:45.559
you're a boss.

576
36:46.480 --> 36:47.519
Would you hire me?

577
36:51.559 --> 36:52.559
I...

578
36:58.320 --> 36:59.320
I'd...

579
37:05.639 --> 37:07.360
want you dead!

580
37:12.079 --> 37:13.079
Want me dead?

581
37:13.719 --> 37:14.880
Starting this again, are we?

582
37:19.119 --> 37:19.800
All done.

583
37:19.801 --> 37:20.919
Patched you up.

584
37:20.920 --> 37:21.920
You should head home.

585
37:24.000 --> 37:25.000
Wait a second.

586
37:26.360 --> 37:27.360
I...

587
37:27.679 --> 37:28.679
Sit back down first.

588
37:32.599 --> 37:33.719
What else do you want?

589
37:36.280 --> 37:38.559
Look, you didn't stick this on right.

590
37:38.639 --> 37:39.919
See? It's peeling off, isn't it?

591
37:41.800 --> 37:42.800
Pao Bei!

592
37:43.039 --> 37:44.039
You're back!

593
37:44.360 --> 37:45.719
Why aren't you coming inside?

594
37:47.559 --> 37:48.760
I just have a few things

595
37:49.519 --> 37:50.599
to talk over with this guy.

596
37:55.320 --> 37:56.400
Wait, are you...

597
37:56.599 --> 37:58.839
that big evil monster my brother's always talking about?

598
37:59.760 --> 38:00.760
Why are you at our house?

599
38:01.440 --> 38:03.376
You're not here to take my brother away, are you?

600
38:03.400 --> 38:04.400
I won't let you!

601
38:07.480 --> 38:08.598
Don't worry.

602
38:08.599 --> 38:10.079
I won't take your brother away.

603
38:10.480 --> 38:11.480
Besides,

604
38:12.079 --> 38:14.559
is this how your brother talks about me behind my back?

605
38:15.920 --> 38:17.639
An evil monster?

606
38:20.159 --> 38:21.360
It's okay, Xiaotong.

607
38:21.400 --> 38:22.079
Don't worry.

608
38:22.280 --> 38:23.416
No one is taking me anywhere.

609
38:23.440 --> 38:24.440
Oh.

610
38:25.000 --> 38:26.000
That's good.

611
38:26.119 --> 38:27.119
Bro,

612
38:27.159 --> 38:28.480
I'm gonna go take out the trash.

613
38:28.599 --> 38:29.599
Okay.

614
38:32.800 --> 38:34.320
Does he hate me?

615
38:35.280 --> 38:36.840
I can't believe you actually noticed.

616
38:37.960 --> 38:39.559
My brother rarely hates anyone.

617
38:40.280 --> 38:42.039
You're one of the few.

618
38:42.960 --> 38:44.440
Why does he hate me?

619
38:44.679 --> 38:46.239
And why did he call me an evil monster?

620
38:46.599 --> 38:47.760
Well, he's not wrong.

621
38:48.000 --> 38:49.198
You're always picking on me.

622
38:49.199 --> 38:50.776
If you're not a monster, then what are you?

623
38:50.800 --> 38:51.839
Besides,

624
38:51.840 --> 38:53.519
having people hate you,

625
38:54.320 --> 38:55.960
aren't you used to that by now?

626
38:58.320 --> 38:58.760
Hey.

627
38:58.760 --> 38:59.760
Huh?

628
39:00.039 --> 39:00.639
Come here.

629
39:00.639 --> 39:01.639
Okay.

630
39:07.360 --> 39:08.360
Do you hate me?

631
39:08.559 --> 39:09.559
Yeah.

632
39:10.760 --> 39:13.280
If you're nicer to me, I'll stop hating you.

633
39:13.519 --> 39:14.519
Tell me, then.

634
39:15.679 --> 39:16.879
How can I be nicer to you?

635
39:16.880 --> 39:18.239
Do something that makes me happy,

636
39:18.880 --> 39:20.320
and I won't hate you anymore.

637
39:20.599 --> 39:21.839
Something that makes you happy?

638
39:23.039 --> 39:24.440
What would make you happy?

639
39:24.679 --> 39:26.159
Even if I tell you, you won't do it.

640
39:26.480 --> 39:27.480
I'm not telling.

641
39:28.159 --> 39:29.159
Just tell me.

642
39:29.519 --> 39:30.519
I promise I'll do it.

643
39:30.719 --> 39:31.719
I don't believe you.

644
39:32.599 --> 39:34.079
What is it with you and your brother?

645
39:34.199 --> 39:36.095
Were you two lied to your whole lives or something?

646
39:36.119 --> 39:37.440
You don't trust anyone.

647
39:38.639 --> 39:39.959
So you're not gonna tell me, huh?

648
39:40.039 --> 39:40.519
Fine.

649
39:40.719 --> 39:41.759
I'll figure it out myself.

650
39:47.519 --> 39:48.519
A Pong,

651
39:49.159 --> 39:50.279
I need to ask you for a favor.

652
39:50.280 --> 39:51.800
Please look after Xiaotong and Xiaoya.

653
39:52.000 --> 39:53.360
Just tell them

654
39:54.519 --> 39:55.960
that I took on a well-paying job

655
39:58.039 --> 40:00.079
and have to go away on a business trip for a while.

656
40:00.760 --> 40:02.440
Tell them to be good,

657
40:02.920 --> 40:05.200
and I'll take them to the amusement park when I get back.

658
40:08.239 --> 40:09.535
I'll take you guys to the amusement park.

659
40:09.559 --> 40:10.559
How does that sound?

660
40:11.440 --> 40:12.159
Huh?

661
40:12.160 --> 40:13.319
The amusement park?

662
40:13.320 --> 40:14.360
Yeah.

663
40:14.840 --> 40:16.638
Can my sister come too?

664
40:16.639 --> 40:17.920
Of course she can.

665
40:18.519 --> 40:19.199
Big bro,

666
40:19.400 --> 40:20.519
can we go?

667
40:26.760 --> 40:27.440
It just so happens.

668
40:27.441 --> 40:29.599
Milan has an event at the amusement park tomorrow.

669
40:30.760 --> 40:32.280
Invite your buddies to come along too.

670
40:33.880 --> 40:36.359
I already had the organizers get tickets for them anyway.

671
40:36.360 --> 40:40.360
Consider it your Boss P'Eng being generous

672
40:41.880 --> 40:43.239
and calling a truce.

673
40:43.760 --> 40:44.760
What do you say?
